1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 13=

17
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:33,640
Move! Move!

18
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,359
Make way! Make way!

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,480
Officer Luo.

20
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,879
Excuse me. Let me through.

21
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:53,400
Make way.

22
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,280
Excuse me.

23
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:08,360
Stay back!

24
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,719
Back off! Back off!

25
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:10,759
You can't go in!

26
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:11,439
Back off!

27
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,599
Mrs. Hui! Mrs. Hui!

28
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:13,479
Mrs. Hui!

29
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:14,080
You can't go in!

30
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,199
Get back!

31
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,159
What's all the noise?

32
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:18,439
Move!

33
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:18,919
What's going on?

34
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:20,039
What's all this?

35
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:20,599
Mrs. Hui!

36
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,759
That's my sister-in-law!

37
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:22,800
That's my sister-in-law!

38
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,960
Let me in!

39
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,840
Just let me see her!

40
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,240
This area is sealed off.

41
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,479
Nobody goes in.

42
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,039
Either stay here and watch,

43
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,360
or come back to the station with me!

44
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,960
Darn Dongshan Tai...

45
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,000
That scumbag...

46
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,159
I'll kill him!

47
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,719
Lin, calm down!

48
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,360
Calm down!

49
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,520
Ling Che.

50
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,719
If you're my brother,

51
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:55,680
don't stand in my way.

52
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,159
It's because you're my brother

53
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:58,000
that I won't let you
get yourself killed!

54
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,120
I want him dead too!

55
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,439
But we don't have any proof!

56
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,360
Proof?

57
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:03,319
I'm not a cop!

58
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,719
Why the hell do I need proof?

59
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:05,759
Get out of my way!

60
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,280
What, are you scared?

61
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,759
Beat me, and you can go!

62
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:15,800
Go ahead!

63
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:17,680
Go.

64
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,280
What?

65
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:31,680
Hey! You!

66
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,639
You still want to fight?

67
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:40,400
You want to come back with me,

68
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:41,439
huh?

69
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,879
Let go of me!

70
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,879
Lin.

71
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:10,919
What?

72
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,759
Come on.

73
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,680
Che.

74
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:28,120
Lin was bad.

75
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,079
Che was bad too.

76
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:35,120
Che.

77
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,439
Che.

78
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,040
Shake hands.

79
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:46,000
Come on, shake hands.

80
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:59,000
Che is Lin's brother too.

81
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,000
Che.

82
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:02,560
Put this on.

83
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:04,319
Here.

84
00:05:04,519 --> 00:05:06,600
It won't hurt once you put it on.

85
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,399
What are you doing?

86
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:28,680
Fu.

87
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,399
Go get some rest.

88
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,800
I'm going to bed.

89
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,560
Good night.

90
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,480
Good night.

91
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:39,199
Good night.

92
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,480
Tell me...

93
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,439
Boss Hui was loyal to everyone
around him.

94
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,639
How did he end up like this?

95
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,920
His wife and daughter

96
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,519
didn't do anything wrong.

97
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,600
Why did they have to end up
like this too?

98
00:05:58,959 --> 00:05:59,959
People like us...

99
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,800
maybe this is just how it ends.

100
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,879
Would it be any different anywhere else?

101
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:11,839
Didn't you say,

102
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,879
"Wherever there are people,
there will be conflict"?

103
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,279
What are you gonna do now?

104
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,800
I don't know.

105
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,120
Now the only people

106
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:31,639
I have left are you and my brother.

107
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,399
I want to avenge Boss Hui.

108
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,959
And I want to protect you
and my brother.

109
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:51,800
Lin.

110
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,399
I'll protect you both too.

111
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,160
Some protection. You nearly killed me!

112
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,759
I'm still hurting like hell.

113
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:14,000
Officer Luo.

114
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,160
Boss Hui...

115
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,560
Shuangdao Hui's wife and daughter
were murdered.

116
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,680
Headquarters was in complete chaos,

117
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,079
so,

118
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,720
I couldn't get away

119
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,600
to report in at the agreed time.

120
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,079
The Deputy Commissioner informed me

121
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,319
that we will make the arrests
in two months.

122
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,680
Until then, you need
to be extra careful.

123
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:29,399
The arrests?

124
00:07:30,959 --> 00:07:32,720
Shuangdao Hui may have been framed.

125
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,000
His wife and daughter were innocent too.

126
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,800
Three people are dead.

127
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,399
Couldn't we at least...

128
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:37,120
They're gangsters.

129
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,519
They're a cancer on this city.

130
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,680
What are their lives

131
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:43,399
compared to the stability of Shicheng?

132
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:49,279
Shicheng needs you now more than ever.

133
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,240
Take advantage of their infighting

134
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,120
and gather more evidence.

135
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:55,399
Then when we take them down,

136
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:57,160
we can take them all down at once.

137
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:04,959
What's wrong?

138
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:08,040
Aren't you happy you can
finally be a cop again?

139
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:09,879
Yeah. Of course.

140
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,759
Officer Luo.

141
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,399
Shen Yanlin isn't a bad person.

142
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,519
He only joined Dongcheng Gang

143
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,560
because he had no other choice.

144
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,800
After the operation,

145
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,920
I think we could keep him
on as an informant.

146
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,600
Keep him as an informant?

147
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:26,319
You're getting sentimental
about a gangster?

148
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:30,920
If Shen Yanlin knew who you really were,

149
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,720
what do you think he'd do?

150
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,360
He'd kill you without a second thought.

151
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,759
Remember who you are.

152
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,279
And remember who he is.

153
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,279
Don't forget

154
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,399
the oath you took at the police academy.

155
00:08:52,559 --> 00:08:53,200
Yes, sir.

156
00:09:30,735 --> 00:09:32,642
(Loyalty)

157
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,879
Boss Lin.

158
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,279
It's my fault.

159
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,320
It's my fault. Boss Lin.

160
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,639
We should've stopped the deal

161
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:52,639
the moment we saw a stranger.

162
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,679
Punish us, Boss Lin.

163
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:55,799
We'll take it.

164
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,159
Punish you?

165
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:04,080
Even if I punish you,

166
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,360
it won't bring Boss Hui back.

167
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:09,360
Fei Liu deliberately set us up.

168
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:11,320
We may have dodged it this time,

169
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,519
but we won't dodge the next one.

170
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,480
And we don't even have proof.

171
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:16,879
Even if we did,

172
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,600
Fei Liu has Dongshan Tai behind him.

173
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:22,960
We can't beat them.

174
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,720
So we're just supposed to do nothing?

175
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:26,720
B-Boss Hui's death...

176
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,200
We will avenge him.

177
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:30,679
He won't have died for nothing.

178
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:32,919
But we have to wait.

179
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,519
Wait for what, Boss Lin?

180
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,399
Until the day I become

181
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,519
the shot-caller.

182
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,080
You can leave.

183
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,879
A lot of people in the underworld
want that position.

184
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,159
The higher you climb,
the greater the risks

185
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:03,159
and the more fights you'll face.

186
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,279
There's no turning back.

187
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:05,919
Lin.

188
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,879
Are you sure about this?

189
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,240
With you and my brother by my side,

190
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,440
I'm not afraid of anything.

191
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,200
I have to avenge

192
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,559
Boss Hui.

193
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,240
Will you help me?

194
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,000
Where else would I go?

195
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:06,320
Boss Jiu.

196
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:07,600
Boss Ji.

197
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,440
Boss Hui died under
suspicious circumstances.

198
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:11,840
I couldn't even protect his family.

199
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,120
I failed him and the trust
he placed in me.

200
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:16,759
Well...

201
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:18,840
Sit down.

202
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:27,360
I know I haven't been around long,

203
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,399
but Boss Hui

204
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,039
must be avenged.

205
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:39,120
I want Boss Hui's memorial tablet
enshrined at Loyalty Hall,

206
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:41,240
where everyone in the gang
can pay their respects.

207
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,440
I want to become the shot-caller.

208
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,320
I'm asking for your support.

209
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,679
Hui entrusted his businesses to you.

210
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,639
I have no objection.

211
00:12:53,639 --> 00:12:55,679
But what do you have to go
up against Dongshan Tai?

212
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,840
Dongshan Tai has Mai Gao,

213
00:12:59,159 --> 00:12:59,919
Fei Liu,

214
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,559
and a few fence-sitters in his pocket.

215
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:07,480
What have you got?

216
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,320
I...

217
00:13:29,919 --> 00:13:30,759
only got you two.

218
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:34,159
You've certainly got determination.

219
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:37,159
Lin, if you want to be the shot-caller,

220
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,960
you'll have to prove yourself.

221
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,159
Don't disappoint me.

222
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,879
I think you've got what it takes.

223
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:45,919
You have my support.

224
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,639
Thank you both.

225
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:54,440
Young people these days

226
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,720
really don't know their place.

227
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,279
Every nobody out there

228
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,960
thinks he can run for the shot-caller.

229
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:01,840
Bao Zun.

230
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,919
Why don't you run too?

231
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,440
Go be the shot-caller

232
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,440
for a change.

233
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,399
Who becomes the shot-caller

234
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:13,879
isn't what matters.

235
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,480
What matters

236
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,679
is where Dakou Jiu, Men Datou,

237
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:20,639
and the other senior members stand.

238
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,000
That's what decides it.

239
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,399
They all saw

240
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,440
what happened to Hui.

241
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,320
So how do you think they'll choose?

242
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,000
That kid

243
00:14:31,759 --> 00:14:33,519
probably can't even collect
protection money.

244
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:45,000
We pay protection money today,

245
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,200
then we have to pay again tomorrow.

246
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:48,039
One boss comes and takes his cut,

247
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:49,600
then another one shows up asking
for more.

248
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,480
Everything we make

249
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,679
goes straight to protection money.

250
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:53,360
And what do we get?

251
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,480
Citou took over three of my shops,

252
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,480
and he still hasn't given them back.

253
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:57,600
Nonsense!

254
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,440
They were mine to begin with!

255
00:15:00,679 --> 00:15:01,639
What, trying to sneak a kiss?

256
00:15:06,399 --> 00:15:08,200
Those shops belonged to her
in the first place.

257
00:15:08,639 --> 00:15:10,320
Just give them back and be done with it.

258
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,679
Who are you?

259
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,159
Why should I give them back just
because you say so?

260
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,360
On what grounds?

261
00:15:15,799 --> 00:15:18,200
Because her name is on the deed.

262
00:15:19,159 --> 00:15:19,679
And

263
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,559
I've got the best lawyer in Shicheng.

264
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,480
So, court or give the place back?

265
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,159
From now on, on the third
of every month,

266
00:15:28,559 --> 00:15:29,960
my guys will come collect
the protection money.

267
00:15:31,039 --> 00:15:32,360
If anyone else tries to collect
from you,

268
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:33,440
I'll deal with it.

269
00:15:33,679 --> 00:15:34,480
Easy for you to say.

270
00:15:35,559 --> 00:15:37,080
Shuangdao Hui is gone now.

271
00:15:37,799 --> 00:15:38,639
Why should I trust you,

272
00:15:38,639 --> 00:15:39,480
some green kid?

273
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:42,759
I think we'd be safer

274
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,679
paying Fei Liu.

275
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,320
Right?

276
00:15:44,559 --> 00:15:45,320
Right!

277
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:46,960
Fei Liu.

278
00:15:54,159 --> 00:15:55,639
Get lost!

279
00:15:59,879 --> 00:16:01,960
Fei Liu has what, a few lousy boats?

280
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:04,399
His shipping routes

281
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,759
are slow and unreliable.

282
00:16:08,279 --> 00:16:08,919
Me?

283
00:16:09,879 --> 00:16:11,600
I've got plenty of land routes.

284
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,960
They're faster and safer.

285
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,440
Business is business.

286
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,159
It's about making sure everyone wins.

287
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:19,519
I want all of your businesses
to grow too,

288
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,000
and keep getting bigger.

289
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:21,840
Right?

290
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,600
Exactly.

291
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:24,960
Oh, cut the crap.

292
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,519
You're just one of Shuangdao Hui's dogs.

293
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:29,399
Why should any of us trust you?

294
00:16:30,039 --> 00:16:31,000
What's wrong with you?

295
00:16:32,559 --> 00:16:33,960
You're really loud.

296
00:16:37,159 --> 00:16:38,320
Nice shot!

297
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:46,639
What are you doing?

298
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,000
Officer Luo.

299
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:55,480
Playing pool isn't illegal, is it?

300
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,720
Shen Yanlin, listen to me.

301
00:16:58,399 --> 00:17:00,320
I don't care whether you used
to run with Shuangdao Hui

302
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,360
or Dongshan Tai.

303
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,240
As far as I'm concerned,
there are only two kinds of people:

304
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,759
those who follow the rules,

305
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,200
and those who don't.

306
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,799
Which one are you going to be?

307
00:17:09,392 --> 00:17:12,303
♪Live by the blade, die by the blade♪

308
00:17:15,721 --> 00:17:18,490
♪Ride the waves
and you may drown in them♪

309
00:17:21,154 --> 00:17:23,736
♪If you gamble your life, go all in♪

310
00:17:24,396 --> 00:17:28,209
♪Leave it to fate. Take it if you dare♪

311
00:17:34,935 --> 00:17:37,695
♪They say every brother has his price♪

312
00:17:37,696 --> 00:17:40,914
♪They say this world swallows you whole♪

313
00:17:41,652 --> 00:17:44,285
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

314
00:17:44,286 --> 00:17:47,425
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

315
00:17:47,892 --> 00:17:51,852
♪I was born too tough to break♪

316
00:17:54,858 --> 00:17:58,249
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

317
00:18:00,941 --> 00:18:05,314
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

318
00:18:07,747 --> 00:18:11,018
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

319
00:18:14,558 --> 00:18:17,078
♪Incense fades, but ashes still burn♪

320
00:18:17,125 --> 00:18:20,201
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪

321
00:18:21,081 --> 00:18:23,574
♪On this long road, never bow your head♪

322
00:18:23,647 --> 00:18:27,025
♪On this road, there's no turning back♪

323
00:18:27,272 --> 00:18:30,387
♪The faces onstage keep changing♪

324
00:18:30,831 --> 00:18:33,951
♪While blood below keeps pooling♪

325
00:18:34,102 --> 00:18:36,648
♪Never bow. I call the shots here♪
